<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="skill">steel-lockpicks</ansi> (blacksmithing recipe)

A set of precision-crafted steel lockpicks, refined for experienced
locksmiths. Superior tensile strength allows for more reliable contact
with internal mechanisms, making difficult locks more manageable.

<ansi fg="yellow">━━━ Crafting ━━━</ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Skill:</ansi>       blacksmithing (minimum 20)
  <ansi fg="yellow">Station:</ansi>     forge
  <ansi fg="yellow">Ingredients:</ansi> steel bar (x2), iron ingot (x1),
                  crafting steel (x1)

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help blacksmithing</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help craft</ansi>, <ansi fg="command">help picklock</ansi>
